    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_01",
      "hash64": "E12A2F57CA10E111",
      "text": "Hey, hey, heyyy![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_02",
      "hash64": "E12A2C57CA10DBF8",
      "text": "Your eyeballs are MINE—caught in my\\nElectroweb! Whosawhatsit? Iono! I’m the Gym\\r\\nLeader here! ’Ello, ’ello, hola! Ciao and bonjour![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_01",
      "hash64": "09252C6E0C8AF7B4",
      "text": "The Gym Leader?!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_02",
      "hash64": "09252F6E0C8AFCCD",
      "text": "’Ello, ’ello, hola! Ciao and bonjour!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03a",
      "hash64": "AB88D62C5AA8DE3E",
      "text": "Indeedy-doo! I kick it as Gym Leader when I’m\\nnot producin’ sweet content on the internet as an\\r\\ninfluencer to bring dreams to the masses![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03b",
      "hash64": "AB88D52C5AA8DC8B",
      "text": "Oh snap! Look at you—already a master of\\nIono-ese! Not your first rodeo, then, eh?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03",
      "hash64": "E12A2D57CA10DDAB",
      "text": "And, uh...I hope this doesn’t come as too much of\\na surprise, but you’re bein’ broadcast live to the\\r\\nworld right now! Smile![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_04",
      "hash64": "E12A3257CA10E62A",
      "text": "Anywho, challenger! Thanks for coming out to the\\nLevincia Gym to see me![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_05",
      "hash64": "E12A3357CA10E7DD",
      "text": "I’m super happy you’re here, but I’m also a bit of\\na celeb, ya know? I’m all kiiinds of busy![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_06",
      "hash64": "E12A3057CA10E2C4",
      "text": "So I can’t collab with you unless I know you can\\nbring in those sweet, sweet viewer numb—\\c\\nEr, I mean, I gotta make sure you can bring\\nsome real passion to my stream! Nyohoho![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 177,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_07",
      "hash64": "E12A3157CA10E477",
      "text": "And! So! If you wanna battle me, you’re gonna\\nhave to help me make this livestream a viral hit\\r\\nfirst! Got it?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_08",
      "hash64": "E12A2657CA10D1C6",
      "text": "I can tell you just can’t wait to get started! Well,\\nwell, WELL then! Allow me to explain the plan![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_20",
      "hash64": "E1232257CA0AAC4C",
      "text": "Come on out, Mr. Walksabout![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "3DA8B550A77FB5A5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Oh, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. What a\\ncoincidence,\\r\\nmeeting\\r\\nyou here.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
